{
  "id": "E377",
  "title": "A Good Solution For Insomnia",
  "level": "upper intermediate",
  "date": "2019-11-15",
  "synopsis": "A good method to fall asleep… Or is it?",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/50377/bc694669321fd5dc639055435ae26b64df891201.mp3?1573478560",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "失眠良药\n\n病人：医生，我最近总是睡不着\n医生：我教你一个办法，你可以躺在床上数水饺。\n病人：水饺？不是数羊吗？\n医生：外国人数羊是因为在英语里，“羊”和“睡觉”听起来差不多。在汉语，“水饺”和“睡觉”差不多，所以你得数“水饺”。\n病人：有道理。那我回去试试。\n（第二天）\n医生：你没睡好吗？怎么看起来这么累？\n病人：别提了，我按照你说的数“水饺”。数到三百多个的时候我都快睡着了。\n医生：那不是很好吗？\n病人：然后我就饿了。",
    "traditional": "失眠良藥\n\n病人：醫生，我最近總是睡不著\n醫生：我教你一個辦法，你可以躺在床上數水餃。\n病人：水餃？不是數羊嗎？\n醫生：外國人數羊是因為在英語裡，“羊”和“睡覺”聽起來差不多。在漢語，“水餃”和“睡覺”差不多，所以你得數“水餃”。\n病人：有道理。那我回去試試。\n（第二天）\n醫生：你沒睡好嗎？怎麼看起來這麼累？\n病人：別提了，我按照你說的數“水餃”。數到三百多個的時候我都快睡著了。\n醫生：那不是很好嗎？\n病人：然後我就餓了。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "A Good Solution For Insomnia"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "病人：医生，我最近总是睡不着",
      "traditional": "病人：醫生，我最近總是睡不著",
      "pinyin": "bìng rén yī shēng wǒ zuì jìn zǒng shì shuì bù zháo",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Patient: Doctor, lately I always have trouble falling asleep."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "医生：我教你一个办法，你可以躺在床上数水饺。",
      "traditional": "醫生：我教你一個辦法，你可以躺在床上數水餃。",
      "pinyin": "yī shēng wǒ jiāo nǐ yí ge bàn fǎ nǐ kě yǐ tǎng zài chuáng shang shǔ shuǐ jiǎo",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Doctor: I’ll teach you a method. You can lie in bed and count dumplings."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "病人：水饺？不是数羊吗？",
      "traditional": "病人：水餃？不是數羊嗎？",
      "pinyin": "bìng rén shuǐ jiǎo bú shì shǔ yáng ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Patient: Dumplings? Isn’t it counting sheep?"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "医生：外国人数羊是因为在英语里，“羊”和“睡觉”听起来差不多。",
      "traditional": "醫生：外國人數羊是因為在英語裡，“羊”和“睡覺”聽起來差不多。",
      "pinyin": "yī shēng wài guó rén shǔ yáng shì yīn wèi zài yīng yǔ lǐ yáng hé shuì jiào tīng qi lai chà bu duō",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "在汉语，“水饺”和“睡觉”差不多，所以你得数“水饺”。",
      "traditional": "在漢語，“水餃”和“睡覺”差不多，所以你得數“水餃”。",
      "pinyin": "zài hàn yǔ shuǐ jiǎo hé shuì jiào chà bu duō suǒ yǐ nǐ děi shǔ shuǐ jiǎo",
      "english": "Doctor: Foreigners count sheep because in English “sheep” sounds almost like “sleep”."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "In Chinese, “dumpling” sounds almost like “sleeping”, so you need to count “dumplings”."
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "病人：有道理。那我回去试试。",
      "traditional": "病人：有道理。那我回去試試。",
      "pinyin": "bìng rén yǒu dào li nà wǒ huí qù shì shi",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Patient: Makes sense. I will go back and try it out."
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "（第二天）",
      "traditional": "（第二天）",
      "pinyin": "dì èr tiān",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "(The next day)"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "医生：你没睡好吗？怎么看起来这么累？",
      "traditional": "醫生：你沒睡好嗎？怎麼看起來這麼累？",
      "pinyin": "yī shēng nǐ méi shuì hǎo ma zěn me kàn qǐ lái zhè me lèi",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Doctor: Didn’t you sleep well? How come you look so tired?"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "simplified": "病人：别提了，我按照你说的数“水饺”。",
      "traditional": "病人：別提了，我按照你說的數“水餃”。",
      "pinyin": "bìng rén bié tí le wǒ àn zhào nǐ shuō de shǔ shuǐ jiǎo",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "simplified": "数到三百多个的时候我都快睡着了。",
      "traditional": "數到三百多個的時候我都快睡著了。",
      "pinyin": "shǔ dào sān bǎi duō ge de shí hou wǒ dōu kuài shuì zháo le",
      "english": "Patient: Don’t bring it up. I counted dumplings in accordance with what you said."
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "By the time I had counted over three hundred, I had almost fallen asleep."
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "simplified": "医生：那不是很好吗？",
      "traditional": "醫生：那不是很好嗎？",
      "pinyin": "yī shēng nà bú shì hěn hǎo ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Doctor: Isn’t that very good?"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "simplified": "病人：然后我就饿了。",
      "traditional": "病人：然後我就餓了。",
      "pinyin": "bìng rén rán hòu wǒ jiù è le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Patient: Then I got hungry."
    }
  ],
