    "sentence_translations": [
      "A Good Solution For Insomnia",
      "",
      "Patient: Doctor, lately I always have trouble falling asleep.",
      "",
      "Doctor: I’ll teach you a method. You can lie in bed and count dumplings.",
      "",
      "Patient: Dumplings? Isn’t it counting sheep?",
      "",
      "Doctor: Foreigners count sheep because in English “sheep” sounds almost like “sleep”.",
      "In Chinese, “dumpling” sounds almost like “sleeping”, so you need to count “dumplings”.",
      "",
      "Patient: Makes sense. I will go back and try it out.",
      "",
      "(The next day)",
      "",
      "Doctor: Didn’t you sleep well? How come you look so tired?",
      "",
      "Patient: Don’t bring it up. I counted dumplings in accordance with what you said.",
      "By the time I had counted over three hundred, I had almost fallen asleep.",
      "",
      "Doctor: Isn’t that very good?",
      "",
      "Patient: Then I got hungry.",
      ""
